WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.350
Meet NexoLog, a management system connecting inventory,
orders and deliveries.

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:12.052
Operations and their metrics come together in an
organized interface.

3
00:00:13.308 --> 00:00:18.996
The dashboard shows orders, order value, low stock and
pending shipments.

4
00:00:19.346 --> 00:00:25.970
Stock movements, recent orders and alerts help you
monitor daily operations.

5
00:00:27.225 --> 00:00:33.513
Each product has a category, brand, specification or
variant, and barcode.

6
00:00:33.863 --> 00:00:39.503
Stock balances, reservations and movements keep
incoming and outgoing goods under control.

7
00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:46.743
The Kanban board organizes orders into pending,
processing, shipped and delivered.

8
00:00:47.093 --> 00:00:52.493
Choose start and end dates to view a specific period
while preserving the full history.

9
00:00:53.725 --> 00:00:59.581
Tracking simulates the journey on a schematic map, with
automatic delivery stages.

10
00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:07.323
Events are saved and feed reports and the audit log.
This demonstration does not use live GPS.

11
00:01:08.558 --> 00:01:14.438
Suppliers are organized by category, contact, city and
status.

12
00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:20.716
Filters and a detail panel make it easier to find and
maintain supplier records.

13
00:01:21.975 --> 00:01:27.735
The customer area brings records, contact details and
metrics together on one screen.

14
00:01:28.085 --> 00:01:33.605
The list includes filters and internal scrolling to
keep information accessible.

15
00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:40.898
Reports show inventory turnover, fulfillment time and
order value by category.

16
00:01:41.248 --> 00:01:47.080
Select a period, export data and review the history of
actions performed in the system.

17
00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:54.158
User management controls roles, permissions and
recorded activities.

18
00:01:54.508 --> 00:02:02.500
The project combines React, FastAPI and SQLite to
integrate the interface, rules and persistence.

19
00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:11.111
The Windows version includes fictional transactions
spanning 2024 to 2026.

20
00:02:11.461 --> 00:02:19.405
Download the executable from the project card and
choose the demo login. NexoLog: your operation,
connected.
